      "machineText": "*Binding dibuat di `frontend/bindings/`.* Wails memeriksa layanan Go yang Anda daftarkan dan menulis SDK yang aman secara tipe di sana. Anda dapat mengimpornya seperti modul lain:",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "*Bindings are generated into `frontend/bindings/`.* Wails inspects your registered Go services and w…",
